sequenceDiagram
title Exception Flow: Recommendation Service Error
   actor User
   box Museum Recommendation System
       participant WebApp
       participant Recommender
       participant UserDatabase
       participant MuseumDatabase
   end


   User->>WebApp: User opens app and request recs
   activate WebApp
   WebApp->>Recommender: Fetch Recommendations
   activate Recommender
   note right of Recommender: Recommender Failure - Unavailable
   Recommender-->>WebApp: Error and No Response returned
   deactivate Recommender
   WebApp-->>User: Shows "Error: Service Unavailable"
   deactivate WebApp
